      "be155459824895_html": "<h3 class=\"beae-typo-h2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Our Client Reviews</span></h3>",
      "be1134828945_html": "\"This robot vacuum has been a lifesaver for our home! With two kids and a dog, keeping the floors clean used to be a daily chore. Now, I just set the schedule, and it takes care of everything while I focus on other tasks. Truly a game-changer!\"",
      "be571677504_html": "\"As someone who loves smart home gadgets, this robot vacuum exceeded my expectations. The integration with my smart home system was seamless, and the cleaning performance is top-notch. I was especially impressed with the Black Friday deal—I couldn’t resist!\"",
      "be1052121629_html": "\"I was skeptical at first, but this robot vacuum has impressed me with its ability to clean both hardwood floors and carpets effortlessly. It’s quiet, efficient, and fits perfectly into my minimalist home design. The Black Friday discount was just the cherry on top!\"",
      "be1328665351_html": "\"I bought this robot vacuum during the Black Friday sale, and it’s one of the best investments I’ve made. It handles the daily dust and debris in my home office with ease, saving me time and keeping the space spotless. Highly recommend!\"",
      "be459767132106_html": "<div class=\"beae-typo-p2\"><span style=\"color:var(--beae-global-colors-white);\">GOT QUESTIONS?</span></div>",
      "be956743426103_html": "<h3 class=\"beae-typo-h2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Frequently Asked Questions</span></h3>",
      "be1856256792_html": "Will the robot vacuums be on sale for Black Friday?",
      "be161050501_html": "How can I ensure I get the best deal on a robot vacuum this Black Friday?",
      "be1263776902_html": "Are there limited quantities available during the Black Friday sale?",
      "be1962162518_html": "Can I use additional promo codes on Black Friday robot vacuum deals?",
      "be1512592379_html": "What is the warranty on robot vacuums purchased during Black Friday?",
      "be1947713980_html": "Yes, our top-rated robot vacuums will be available at significant discounts during our Black Friday sale. Be sure to check the website for the latest deals.",
      "be441772019_html": "Sign up for our newsletter to receive early access to our Black Friday deals. You can also follow us on social media for real-time updates on exclusive offers.\n\n",
      "be115299931_html": "Yes, stock is limited, and our robot vacuums tend to sell out quickly during Black Friday. We recommend shopping early to secure your preferred model.",
      "be714350979_html": "Our Black Friday deals are already heavily discounted, so additional promo codes cannot be applied. However, you’re guaranteed the best price during the sale.Accordion content 2",
      "be1360003942_html": "All robot vacuums purchased during Black Friday come with the same standard warranty as regular purchases, ensuring you get full support and peace of mind.Accordion content 2",
      "be22429808328_html": "<p class=\"beae-typo-h1 text-align-mobile-center\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255, 255, 255);--bts-font-size:100px;--bts-line-height:110px;--bts-letter-spacing:normal;--bts-mobile-font-size:55px;--bts-mobile-line-height:66px;--bts-mobile-letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"beae-text-size\">Don’t Miss Out on Our Exclusive Deals!</span></p>",
      "be1219076301399_html": "<p class=\"beae-typo-p1 text-align-left text-align-mobile-center\"><span style=\"color:var(--beae-global-colors-white);\">Our Black Friday sale is live! Now’s your chance to grab the best deals on top-rated smart home products. Whether you’re looking to upgrade your home or find the perfect gift, we’ve got something for everyone. Shop now and enjoy unbeatable discounts before they’re gone!</span></p>",
      "be282226004_html": "Shop Now"
    },
