      "be849688199_html": "Save {sale}%",
      "be1582798470117_html": "This store is a demo of the Beae template. The products from this store are from the catalog of <b>Wagg Pet Foods</b>",
      "be361808852_html": "Testimonials",
      "be514996358_html": "Real Reviews from Happy Customers",
      "be1202423538_html": "See what real pet owners have to say about our products! From improved health to tail-wagging happiness, our customers share their genuine experiences and how our pet food and accessories have made a difference in their furry friends' lives. Their trust and feedback inspire us to keep delivering the best for your pets! ❤️🐾",
      "be1370365981_html": "Perfect for My Cat’s Sensitive Stomach",
      "be619285219_html": "Ever since switching to this food, my dog’s digestive issues have completely improved! He used to have frequent stomach upsets, but now he’s so much happier, more energetic, and his digestion is much more stable.",
      "be2057235100_html": "— Emma L., Pet Owner",
      "be631047647_html": "Best Fresh Food for My Pup!",
      "be785364333_html": "\"I never realized how much my dog, Bella, would love fresh food until I tried this! She gets so excited every mealtime, and I feel great knowing she's eating healthy, real ingredients. Thank you for making National Pet Day even more special!\"",
      "be79256731_html": "— Jessica L., New York",
      "be2105061246_html": "Healthy &amp; Happy Cats!",
      "be223872404_html": "\"I've been looking for a nutritious option for my two cats, and this has been a game-changer! Their coats are shinier, they have more energy, and they absolutely love the taste. A perfect way to celebrate National Pet Day!\"",
      "be42201588_html": "— Jason W., California",
      "be116963602_html": "Freshness You Can See &amp; Smell!",
      "be1079431123_html": "\"Finally, a pet food brand that truly delivers fresh, quality ingredients! My golden retriever, Max, used to be a picky eater, but now he finishes every bowl. Highly recommend for pet lovers looking to treat their furry friends!\"",
