    "beae-test-scroll1": {
      "be76480_html": "N/A",
      "be430210269_html": "Tax included. ",
      "be72458158275_html": "<a href=\"{{shop.shipping_policy.url}}\">Shipping</a> calculated at checkout.",
      "be727211126_html": "Scroll to the bottom to unlock your surprise offer 💚",
      "be1763167143_html": "Call to action",
      "be586270557_html": "How It All Started",
      "be704210942_html": "Our Journey From Grandma’s Diagnosis to a Mission to Help Others",
      "be298308594_html": "Roots in Denmark",
      "be1905126969_html": "Heart in California",
      "be2071653991_html": "Grandma was sick...",
      "be458104090_html": "We didn’t give up",
      "be691700270_html": "Helping thousands of people",
      "be1968263841_html": "In 2013, doctors gave Grandma Lis just 3 years to live. Searching for relief from the harsh side effects of her medications, we discovered the potential of hemp—and created our first remedy for her.",
      "be2118511968_html": "We poured everything into developing a formula that could help her. It was a leap of faith. But against all odds, it worked—Grandma regained her strength and shocked her doctors.",
      "be1309703961_html": "Her recovery inspired us to start Neurogan. With a mission to offer safe, effective &amp; affordable hemp, we’ve helped thousands find natural relief—just like Grandma Lis did.",
      "be1317041514538_html": "<i>\"I knew the risks and still decided to skip pharmaceuticals. Didn't want rest of my days feeling horrible.</i><div><i>&nbsp;</i></div><div><i>When the Brandrup family introduced me to hemp I was very skeptical, but with nothing to lose I gave it a shot. I never imagined a natural option could help this much. I got relief, sleep &amp; regained appetite that gave me strength to fight.</i></div><div><i>&nbsp;</i></div><div><i>Thanks to the Brandrups &amp; Neurogan, I'm so grateful!\"</i></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>- Grandma Lis</div>",
      "be769675897_html": "Family-owned &amp; operated",
      "be1364706153315_html": "<div>Hi, we're the Brandrups.</div><br><div>After Grandma's eye-opening healing journey in Denmark, we set out to make hemp-extracted hemp accessible worldwide – starting with the USA.</div><br><div>But it was MUCH harder than anticipated, and<b> we nearly went bankrupt in 2020...</b></div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div>",
      "be1196792501_html": "The obstacles",
      "be412477635308_html": "<div>The hemp market had many obstacles: lengthy bureaucratic processes, contradicting regulations, fake product competition, cultural stigmas, and consumers misunderstanding it for weed – just to mention a few.</div><br><div>But we kept going because we experienced its benefits firsthand.</div><div>\r</div>",
      "be514830732_html": "The feedback",
      "be376272433287_html": "<div>And with more than 100,000 clients &amp; 10,000 reviews backing it up – our community agrees.</div><br><div>Now, 10 years later, our mission remains the same: to improve your well-being – just as we did for Grandma.</div><br><div>Welcome to the family!</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div>",
      "be1061668643_html": "Our Business Philosophy",
      "be2048461892_html": "The Values That Guide Every Product We Make",
      "be703407747_html": "Make It Personal",
      "be732719546_html": "If you’re not happy, we’re not happy. We think of you as part of our extended family, and we genuinely care about supporting your health journey.",
      "be1615896391_html": "Make It Right",
      "be460840579_html": "We’re responsible for your health, and we take it seriously. We study hemp research to educate &amp; scientifically formulate our products to be highly effective. 100% Guaranteed to work.",
      "be778793191_html": "Make It Fair",
      "be2135629772_html": "We stand for equitable practices. We price our products to be as affordable as possible, and we are committed to remaining the #1 Best Valued Hemp in the USA.",
      "be285140729_html": "The Shocking Results Of 100+ Hemp Tests",
      "be481453642_html": "After testing hundreds of hemp-based products, we found a serious lack of reliable sources for hemp products in the US.",
      "be976526700_html": "What We Found",
      "be1295402204137_html": "<b>×</b> Failed Safety Test: Heavy Metals<div><b>×</b> Failed Safety Test: Pesticides</div><div><b>×</b> Failed Safety Test: Toxins</div>",
      "be1996992509132_html": "At best, most products had only a fraction of the claimed potency.\r<div>At worst, 4 out of 5 failed critical safety standards.</div>",
      "be394431049_html": "What We Stand For",
      "be685522983160_html": "<b>✓ </b>Lab Verified: High-Potency Full-Spectrum<div><b>✓ </b>3rd Party Lab Tested: Safe &amp; Pure</div><div><b>✓ </b>cGMP-Produced &amp; FDA-Registered</div>",
      "be1326173691_html": "We're committed to changing the standard—through advocacy, transparency, and truly clean hemp.",
      "be1575999658_html": "Pure. Potent. Proven.",
      "be1939802977142_html": "Sign up and unlock a <u><b>buy 1, get 1 free</b></u> offer on high-potency hemp products. 100% relief guarantee — it works or your money back.",
      "be2051925146361_html": "<a href=\"https://neuroganhemp.com/policies/privacy-policy\" type=\"custom\" url=\"https://neuroganhemp.com/policies/privacy-policy\" handle=\"\" title=\"https://neuroganhemp.com/policies/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>|&nbsp;</b> <a href=\"\" type=\"custom\" url=\"\" handle=\"\" title=\"https://neuroganhemp.com/policies/terms-of-service\">Terms of Service</a>",
      "be1210539730_html": "This content is for informational purposes only and does not constitute medical advice. Neurogan products are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Individual results may vary. Always consult a healthcare professional before starting any wellness routine. Testimonials reflect real customer experiences and may include incentivized reviews. Logos shown represent third-party certifications or industry standards and are the property of their respective owners."
    },
