      "be2255103_html": "Home",
      "be77694213_html": "Untitled",
      "be474778094_html": "Approved by thousands of fitness lovers worldwide",
      "be89654742_html": "One of the top-selling home workout machines",
      "be1716999121_html": "Perfect for weight loss, strength, and cardio training",
      "be978022322_html": "From {{ price_min }}",
      "be1950827197_html": "{{ price_normal }}",
      "be145511085251_html": "3k+ people bought in the past month\n<div><br></div>",
      "be40552923329_html": "\n<div>Full Body Workout</div>",
      "be1197338265_html": "Natural Formula That Tastes Good",
      "be1191201615_html": "\nPrevents Infections &amp; Balances pH Naturally",
      "be849688199_html": "Save {sale}%",
      "be1220360021_html": "Quantity",
      "be649020154_html": "Add to cart",
      "be28375103_html": "Out of stock",
      "be1182278043_html": "Added to cart",
      "be1538394658_html": "Sold out",
      "be1427617666_html": "Added to cart successfully",
      "be719299147_html": "Choose options",
      "be56677412_html": "Description",
      "be1687162401_html": "Why Choose This Squat Machine?",
      "be974922461_html": "Who It’s Made For:",
      "be1550717783_html": "Shipping & Returns",
      "be831528510359_html": "✅ Safer than free barbell squats for knees and back\r<div>\r</div><div>✅ Ideal for beginners, seniors, and low-impact training\r</div><div>✅ Compact and foldable for tight spaces\r</div><div>✅ Targets entire lower body and core in one simple motion\r</div><div>✅ Perfect for home gym routines, rehab, and full-body warmups</div><div>\r</div><div>\r</div><div>\r</div>",
      "be749763306315_html": "Women looking to tone glutes and legs\r<div>\r</div><div>Men aiming to build functional lower body strength\r</div><div>Seniors and rehab patients needing joint-friendly exercise\r</div><div>Anyone wanting a fast, full-body lower workout without heavy weights\r</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>\r</div><div>\r</div><div>\r</div>",
      "be18852344_html": "<br>",
      "be824281820_html": "Key Features:",
      "be220498230644_html": "Rubber or spring-Assisted Resistance: Supports your squat motion with smooth, adjustable resistance to reduce knee and back strain.\r<div>\r</div><div>Ergonomic Design: Padded seat and backrest promote proper posture and stability throughout each rep.\r</div><div>Multi-Position Handlebar: Offers multiple grip options for balance and optional upper-body activation.\r</div><div>Foldable &amp; Space-Saving: Easily folds for compact storage—perfect for apartments, home gyms, or small workout areas.\r</div><div>Durable Steel Frame: Heavy-duty construction supports up to 120–150kg, built for long-term use.</div><div>\r</div><div>\r</div><div>\r</div>",
      "be233204646_html": "Home Fitness Enthusiasts",
      "be165214872_html": "Add a tag line",
      "be1942531745_html": "Image with text columns",
      "be2023997302_html": "Column",
      "be347608833128_html": "Pair text with an image to focus on your chosen product, collection, or blog post.<div>Add details on availability, style.</div>",
      "be386800464_html": "Transform Your Workout at Home",
      "be1349254629_html": "Burn calories, build strength &amp; save space with one powerful machine",
      "be1511771053_html": "Time Saving",
      "be608281653_html": "Weight Loss",
      "be1343915869_html": "Foldable Design",
      "be452016440_html": "Leg Cardio",
      "be1301919190_html": "Claire Fournier",
      "be1116485996_html": "I love this squat machine! It gives me a complete workout without needing to go to the gym. Easy to set up and very effective.”",
      "be798807159_html": "Nicolas Roux",
      "be1109022505_html": "The foldable design is a lifesaver. I live in a small apartment, and it fits perfectly under my bed after use. Great for daily workouts.",
      "be2075975139_html": "Camille Dubois",
      "be992918483_html": "I’ve been using it for two weeks and already notice my legs and glutes getting stronger. The resistance levels are perfect for progression.",
      "be2150461_html": "FAQs",
      "be1968020331_html": "What are the main features of the Squat Machine for Home?",
      "be290049830_html": "What types of exercises can I perform with the Squat Machine?",
      "be337328338_html": "Can the Squat Machine be stored easily?",
      "be1185965563_html": "What are the benefits of using a Squat Machine?",
      "be2085102449_html": "Can I use the Squat Machine for both strength training and cardio?",
      "be621602094_html": "&nbsp;The Squat Machine for Home includes adjustable resistance levels, making it versatile for different fitness levels. It combines a squat ride and rowing function to provide a comprehensive workout for your glutes and legs, along with cardio benefits. Its foldable design allows for easy storage and space-saving in your home gym. This machine is engineered for effective workouts, ensuring you can target multiple muscle groups efficiently. Great for users with limited space who still want a full-body exercise solution.",
      "be14036229_html": "With the Squat Machine, you can perform a variety of exercises focused on glutes, legs, and overall cardio fitness. Key exercises include squats, rows, and variations combining both motions for added intensity. You can also engage in circuit training routines by alternating between squatting and rowing actions, providing a dynamic workout experience. This flexibility makes it perfect for tailoring sessions to meet personal fitness goals, be it strength training or cardio-focused workouts.",
      "be1251806993_html": "Absolutely! The Squat Machine’s foldable design allows for easy storage when not in use. You can collapse it and tuck it away in a closet or under your bed, making it an excellent option for those with limited workout space at home. This feature is highly valued by users who appreciate the convenience of maintaining a tidy environment while still having access to their workout equipment whenever they need it.",
      "be1803784388_html": "Using a Squat Machine provides numerous benefits including improved strength and muscle tone in the legs and glutes, enhanced cardiovascular fitness, and efficient space-saving workouts. It promotes better body posture and balance, thanks to its design encouraging proper movement. Additionally, with the combination of squat and rowing functions, you get a full-body workout that maximizes calorie burn. It is particularly beneficial for those looking to achieve toned legs while improving overall fitness.",
      "be770747471_html": "Yes, the Squat Machine is versatile enough for both strength training and cardio workouts. Its unique design allows you to perform squats for strength-building while the rowing function elevates your heart rate, combining elements of both workout types into a single machine. This multifunctionality makes it ideal for users looking to optimize their training sessions, allowing for an effective workout that targets multiple fitness aspects without needing additional equipment."
    },
