      "be920914040_html": "Rainbow Collection",
      "be1952536116_html": "Radiate your inner beauty with our stunning Rainbow jewelry. Bold, colorful, and multi-faceted, each handcrafted piece reflects your vibrant spirit, timeless elegance, and exceptional craftsmanship designed to shine every day",
      "be282226004_html": "Shop Now",
      "be859803726_html": "Handiora Bridal",
      "be1251199969_html": "Meticulously crafted custom engagement rings, designed just for you in three simple steps. Each piece reflects timeless elegance, ethical sourcing, and exquisite craftsmanship to celebrate your unique love story.",
