      "be849688199_html": "Save {sale}%",
      "be1952924329_html": "HANDIORA TOP RATED SELLER IN THE USA",
      "be344936992_html": "Handmade Fine Jewelry",
      "be1754230439_html": "Origin in California",
      "be340996997_html": "Each Handiora piece is thoughtfully handcrafted in California, blending timeless artistry with modern jewelry design.",
      "be1891215765_html": "Loved Across the Globe",
      "be84829788_html": "Our jewelry connects hearts worldwide, cherished by customers who seek elegance, authenticity, and lasting beauty",
      "be371656264_html": "Unique Handmade Collections",
      "be663745662_html": "From sapphires and rubies to conflict-free diamonds, our exclusive designs celebrate individuality and craftsmanship",
      "be902744853_html": "Signature Gemstones",
      "be622537574_html": "From vibrant sapphires and deep emeralds to radiant rubies and sparkling diamonds, every gem we use is chosen for its exceptional quality and enduring elegance.",
      "be903395915_html": "Bracelets",
      "be896908739_html": "From sleek cuffs to dazzling bangles, discover versatile bracelets designed to layer, stack, and shine with timeless elegance.",
      "be355504755_html": "Explore",
      "be739385651_html": "Earrings",
      "be212503417_html": "Discover our diamond and gemstone earrings, crafted to perfection and fully customizable. From timeless stud styles to vibrant gemstone hoops, elevate your look with designs that blend elegance, versatility, and modern charm",
      "be1649251763_html": "Visit us",
      "be587104164_html": "Craft Your Signature Style",
      "be325345830_html": "Each piece of jewelry tells a story. At Handiora, we bring your vision to life with bespoke designs, initials, and engravings—crafted by artisans in California with unmatched care and precision.",
      "be1707217127_html": "EXPLORE PERSONALIZED JEWELRY",
      "be331094541_html": "Handiora – Where Elegance Meets Integrity",
      "be198037290_html": "Crafting Elegance &amp; Quality Since 2009 – Handiora",
      "be1338242144_html": "For 15+ years, we have created eco-friendly, handcrafted designs that celebrate originality, durability, and eternal elegance.",
      "be607274292_html": "For over 15 years, Handiora has specialized in creating fine, handmade jewelry in California. We focus on conflict-free diamonds, rare gemstones, and timeless designs. Each piece is crafted with precision and passion, making it a true reflection of artistry, ethics, and individuality.",
      "be1191847544_html": "SHOP VESES",
      "be926040151_html": "Rare Gemstones &amp; Custom Design",
      "be1177874463_html": "From sapphires and emeralds to bespoke engagement rings, we create meaningful jewelry that reflects your unique story.",
      "be2122742100185_html": "Handmade, Right Here in California<div><br></div><div>Every Handiora jewel is designed and handcrafted in California, blending local craftsmanship with global standards of luxury.</div>",
      "be937375427_html": "Lifetime Warranty &amp; Free Cleaning",
      "be1962239614_html": "Enjoy lifetime warranty and complimentary cleaning service — because your jewelry deserves to shine foreve",
      "be636148703_html": "Certified 18K Gold Jewelry",
