      "be76480_html": "N/A",
      "be430210269_html": "Tax included. ",
      "be72458158275_html": "<a href=\"{{shop.shipping_policy.url}}\">Shipping</a> calculated at checkout.",
      "be83771563020_html": "Reviews <b>(4.9)</b>",
      "be65293411665_html": "The Desk-Mounted Cat Bed<div>Designed for Modern Workspaces</div>",
      "be1301669315_html": "Made for co-existence—giving your cat a place to belong while you work.",
      "be216429055_html": "PURRCHASE NOW",
      "be355504755_html": "Explore",
      "be509266396_html": "WOODEN BEDS",
      "be229771798320_html": "<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Our eco-friendly cat bed is handcrafted from high-quality birch, sourced exclusively from responsibly managed European forests. This sustainable wooden bed makes each piece unique, promotes ethical sourcing, and enhances your cat’s comfort—all while aligning with your environmental values.</p>",
      "be1745175680_html": "SHOP WOODEN",
      "be1866986650_html": "HANDWOVEN BEDS",
      "be1008797209_html": "Explore our handwoven bed, expertly crafted for unparalleled comfort and superior quality. Each handwoven bed includes a plush insert cushion, offering the perfect relaxation spot for your cat to observe and reign over its domain comfortably.",
      "be1791271406_html": "SHOP HANDWOVEN",
      "be2020974675_html": "CUSTOMER SERVICE",
      "be1139228681_html": "We’re here to help. Quality support is built into every order.",
      "be531866397_html": "REFER A FRIEND",
      "be282715910_html": "Share the love—order now and get a discount for friends &amp; family.",
      "be849118450_html": "FAST SHIPPING",
      "be9057398_html": "(US &amp; Canada) Orders deliver within 1 - 6 business days* (excl. pre-orders). International varies.",
      "be632046141_html": "SECURE PAYMENT",
      "be1738677981_html": "Your payment information is processed securely.",
      "be517875218_html": "EFFORTLESS SETUP, SECURE HOLD",
      "be1614776932_html": "DESIGNED FOR VERSATILE MOUNTING",
      "be285414945239_html": "Our cat desk bed design can be attached to your desk or any flat surface with a thickness of up to 2.75 inches. The ERGO PURRCH™ is designed for quick and easy installation, attaching to your desk in under a minute.<div>\n</div><div>\n</div>",
      "be846575823186_html": "<ul><li>Sturdy base evenly distributes weight, safeguarding both your desk and your pet</li><li>360° Degree Rotation</li><li>Non-slip silicone pads to protect your desk surface</li></ul>",
      "be124148722923_html": "PICK YOUR <b>PURRCH</b>",
      "be200056462197_html": "<b>Your desk, your cat, your style!</b><div>Choose between our handwoven or wood beds, paired with a black or white arm assembly for the perfect match. Featured feline models weigh 12–22 lbs.</div>",
      "be55321024143_html": "<span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: center;\">BIRCHWOOD IN MATTE BLACK</span>",
      "be1927546418_html": "VIEW MODEL",
      "be1557906006143_html": "<span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: center;\">BIRCHWOOD IN MATTE WHITE</span>",
      "be1089154853143_html": "<span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: center;\">HANDWOVEN IN MATTE BLACK</span>",
      "be413430129143_html": "<span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: center;\">HANDWOVEN IN MATTE WHITE</span>",
      "be1650941585_html": "HANDCRAFTED, ADJUSTABLE, AND BUILT TO LAST",
      "be491967549_html": "FEATURES",
      "be2112528670_html": "HANDCRAFTED BEDS",
      "be1515412280_html": "176 LB ARM CAPACITY",
      "be1453287682_html": "SECURE & STABLE",
      "be1245751589_html": "360° ROTATION",
      "be546408540_html": "Our handcrafted wood cat beds offer superior quality with a unique, eco-friendly design. Made from responsibly sourced materials, each bed features natural grain patterns and color variations for a one-of-a-kind look.",
      "be1771924272_html": "Built for strength, the arm assembly handles up to 176 lbs, while the Birchwood &amp; Handwoven beds comfortably support pets up to 45 lbs. Perfect for larger cats, this cozy perch offers durability and security. Intended for pet use only.",
      "be1221471859_html": "Featuring non-slip silicone pads, our design ensures enhanced surface protection and a secure hold. The bed easily clamps onto surfaces up to 2.75 inches thick, offering maximum stability for your surface-mounted cat bed setup.",
      "be309925334_html": "Our ergonomic desk-mounted cat bed offers full 360-degree rotation for flexible positioning, letting your cat find the perfect spot. Once adjusted, it locks securely in place, providing optimal comfort for both you and your pet."
    },
