      "be1327142862_html": "How to Use",
      "be1567549244_html": "Benefits ",
      "be1542181248_html": "Frequently Asked Questions ",
      "be1802099515828_html": "<div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>Gently exfoliates for smoother, brighter skin</div><br><div>Effectively clears pores and controls excessive oil</div><div><br></div><div>Helps reduce pigmentation and evens skin tone</div><br><div>Enhances skin hydration and supports collagen production</div><br><div>Offers relaxing aromatherapy benefits with organic essential oils\n</div><div><br></div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div>",
      "be541898529_html": "Why We Love It",
      "be95114943_html": "Regenerates &amp; Firms&nbsp;",
      "be851464850_html": "Natural AHA Fruit Mix (bilberry, sugar cane, orange, lemon, sugar maple) boosts cell turnover, stimulates collagen, and smooths fine lines for youthful resilience.",
      "be1924812781_html": "Exfoliates &amp; Renews&nbsp;",
      "be815916963_html": "&nbsp;AHAs, Papaya Enzyme, and Strawberry gently dissolve dead skin cells for a smoother, fresher, and glowing complexion.",
      "be500079395_html": "Brightens &amp; Fades Hyperpigmentation&nbsp;",
      "be752042294123_html": "AHAs and Niacinamide visibly even skin tone, diminish dark spots, and restore natural radiance.\r<div>\r</div><div><br></div>",
      "be296294646_html": "Clears &amp; Refines Pores",
      "be436329372_html": "Willow Bark’s natural salicylates and detoxifying Kaolin clays help unclog pores, balance oil, and refine skin texture.",
      "be1975245728_html": "&nbsp;Deeply Nourishes &amp; Protects&nbsp;",
      "be2096184568_html": "Macadamia, Olive, Sunflower, and Castor oils replenish lipids while Centella, Chamomile, Calendula, Aloe, Cranberry, and Vitamin E calm, repair, and shield against environmental stress.",
      "be8331162826_html": "<b>How To Use It&nbsp;</b>",
      "be1026450496_html": "Travel Set&nbsp;",
      "be242786539_html": "Pair text with an image to focus on your chosen product, collection, or blog post. Add details on availability, style, or even provide a review.",
      "be1651319191_html": "Build Your Routine",
      "be1265515680_html": "Others Also Viewed",
      "be2091937273_html": "At Laleva Natural, we bring together the best of nature and biotechnology to design skincare that is both holistic and high-performing. Instead of plain water, we use concentrated floral hydrosols—rich in naturally active compounds—to maximize skin benefits. Our formulas combine peptides, algae, mushrooms, and botanicals at higher concentrations for results you can truly see and feel.&nbsp;",
      "be1388152847_html": "Learn More",
      "be1763042898_html": "&nbsp; &nbsp;A Closer Look to the Science&nbsp;",
      "be906092231_html": "The combination of actives provides synchronized action across all layers of the skin.",
      "be1555402512_html": "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.",
      "be706074993_html": "Outer Layer of Epidermis",
      "be875743452_html": "Epidermis",
      "be2043562182_html": "Dermis",
      "be349443652241_html": "\n<div>Stratum Corneum (outermost layer): Enhances immediate hydration by forming a protective film that reduces transepidermal water loss. Supports barrier integrity and delivers antioxidant protection against environmental aggressors.</div>",
      "be1978516521273_html": "<div>Epidermis: Boosts ceramide synthesis to reinforce the lipid barrier, improves moisture retention, regulates sebum production, reduces hyperpigmentation by inhibiting melanin transfer, and calms inflammation. Promotes even skin tone and supports repair processes.</div>",
      "be1943203413_html": "Dermal-Epidermal Junction (DEJ): Strengthens cohesion between layers by stimulating key structural proteins. Protects against matrix degradation and maintains skin elasticity by preserving extracellular components.",
      "be1636596728_html": "Dermis (deep layer): Stimulates fibroblasts to increase collagen and elastin synthesis, enhances hyaluronic acid production for deep hydration and plumping, improves microcirculation, and relaxes muscle contractions to reduce wrinkle depth. Also restores ceramide levels and promotes regeneration of youthful skin architecture.",
      "be37094933_html": "See It In Real Life",
      "be1833171845360_html": "Free from Parabens, phenoxyethanol, phthalates, sulfates (SLS&amp;SLES),<span style=\"color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: MaisonNeue, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">.</span>mineral oils, PEG, silicones, animal ingredients, synthetic fragrances, heavy metals, DEA, petrolatum.&nbsp;",
      "be1141361655_html": "Non-Toxic",
      "be1623772484_html": "Made For All Skin Type",
      "be1473631837_html": "Mother&amp;Daughter Founded",
      "be576265844_html": "Non Comodegenic&nbsp;",
      "be437375005_html": "Natural Origin Ingredients&nbsp;",
      "be670515713_html": "Dermatologically Tested&nbsp;",
      "be295110074_html": "Cruelty Free",
      "be1806325961_html": "Vegan&nbsp;",
      "be495277105_html": "Clean Ingredients&nbsp;",
      "be95156397_html": "Arometherapy",
      "be2097630416_html": "@Lalevanatural",
      "be2049672808_html": "Follow Us On Instagram&nbsp;"
    },
