    "beae-dasdasdasd": {
      "be76480_html": "N/A",
      "be336625510_html": "Free shipping on ALL orders!",
      "be292031635292_html": "<span data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiUWRJMzRtSWo5QldGZk1rMnJQdlpmMiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjIzNTQ5NzM0NCwiZGF0YVR5cGUiOiJzY2VuZSJ9Cg==(/figmeta)--&gt;\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Tibetan Singing Bowls for Healing: Sound That Resonates with the Universe</span>",
      "be191997234175_html": "<span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Ancient tradition meets timeless elegance in a luxurious piece that connects you with nature in the comfort of your space.</span>",
      "be111117022188_html": "By <span style=\"font-weight:700;\">Niya</span><span style=\"font-weight:700;\">na T.</span>",
      "be639109496_html": "Updated June 2025 | 9:41 AM&nbsp;",
      "be1456530290_html": "The human body was shaped by nature, attuned to its rhythm and subtle sounds.",
      "be980364643_html": "Even within the serenity of your space, you are always listening. The hum of technology, the pulse of traffic, and the layered tones of modern living are soundwaves that ripple through you, shaping the rhythm you follow.",
      "be245271959_html": "Not all sound carries the same intention.",
      "be878280753_html": "Delighting your senses with the perfect frequency can heal. It synchronizes your body to nature, with each sound being a gentle wave that leads you down the path of profound relaxation. And it’s possible within the comfort of your own space.",
      "be1056954377_html": "Step away from the pace of modernity and let yourself flow into something timeless. An ancient ritual rooted in centuries of wisdom and gently transforming lives today.",
      "be2009028803284_html": "<span data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiUWRJMzRtSWo5QldGZk1rMnJQdlpmMiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjIzNTQ5NzM0NCwiZGF0YVR5cGUiOiJzY2VuZSJ9Cg==(/figmeta)--&gt;\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">The Ancestral Origins of Soothing Serenity Are in the Himalayas.\r</span>",
      "be183081740_html": "The Ancestral Origins of Soothing Serenity Are in the Himalayas.\r",
      "be1518614240_html": "Tibetan singing bowls echo the form of their namesake, yet function as inverted bells; sculptural pieces shaped from pure metals. When gently tapped or circled with a mallet, they emit a sustained resonance that lingers in the air like a soft wave.",
      "be957211056616_html": "As their name indicates, Tibetan singing bowls trace their origins to the peaceful slopes of the Himalayan region, where they were used in countless ceremonies, daily rituals, and moments of reflection. Their purpose was simple: create a serene atmosphere that invites mind and body to flow in harmony with the universe.&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing:0px;\">Ordinary bowls could not fulfill such a purpose. That is why the privilege of shaping these exquisite art pieces was entrusted only to the most exceptional artisans, whose craft, skill, and reverence have been secretly preserved through generations.</span>",
      "be1646953675_html": "Now, these Tibetan artisans share their craft with the broader world, refining and elevating the singing bowl as a sculpture that looks and sounds as beautiful as the harmony it channels.",
      "be1288581868_html": "Ancient insight enhanced through contemporary beauty, the Serenity Bowl.",
      "be91188106_html": "Introducing the Serenity Bowl, The Heart of Serene Living.\r",
      "be1788566918_html": "Created by handpicked master craftspeople in Nepal, the Serenity Bowl is a refined expression of Tibetan tradition and modern luxury, transforming relaxation into a ritual of graceful elegance.  \r",
      "be1121111108_html": "With just a single use, it invites multisensorial bliss: deep relaxation, enhanced mental clarity, and holistic healing.\r",
      "be1605130691_html": "Handmade in the heart of the Himalayas.",
      "be586409620_html": "There are no machines. No automation. Only hands, rhythm, and intention.",
      "be31306605_html": "Each Serenity Bowl is shaped individually by Nepalese masters using over 1,000 precise strikes in a process that unfolds over days, embedding patience and Himalayan tradition into each vibration you experience. \r",
      "be1605729949_html": "Expertly tuned to the rhythm of nature",
      "be1781613262_html": "The Serenity Bowl blends ancient techniques with contemporary refinement, intentionally and precisely tuned to produce a specific frequency that mirrors the resonance of nature and encourages the sustained healing of mind and body.",
      "be90581708_html": "The result is a layered vibration that lingers in space for over 30 seconds, creating an immersive sound field that fosters deep relaxation, inner harmony, and holistic well-being.",
      "be752395943_html": "Made with premium metals, tested for purity.&nbsp;&nbsp;",
      "be168674322_html": "The Serenity Bowl is forged from pure copper, prized for its exceptional clarity and pristine acoustic qualities, and crafted to meet the highest standards of resonance. While only 1 in 5 singing bowls worldwide meet verified purity benchmarks, every Serenity Bowl is certified clean, reflecting an unwavering commitment to sound quality and holistic wellbeing.&nbsp;",
      "be1326677877_html": "Each bowl undergoes meticulous testing at every stage of its journey, ensuring that its purity mirrors its resonant quality. Every evaluation is a promise to protect your space and deliver a nurturing experience for both mind and body.\r",
      "be1472487617_html": "Sculptural piece designed for elevated sophistication.\r",
      "be1954318021_html": "More than just a sound vessel, the Serenity Bowl is an artistic ode to relaxation, committed to bringing both clear tones and visual grace to your space.",
      "be239188790_html": "Its presentation is curated with intention, from the lustrous finish of the bowl to the artisan-crafted cushions and mallets that accompany it. Every element is crafted from exquisite high-quality materials, evoking a harmony of texture and form that brings effortless elegance to your space.",
      "be1334666326_html": "Ethically sourced to support local communities.&nbsp;",
      "be1282351686_html": "True serenity begins with ethical intention. From its earliest design to its final form, the Serenity Bowl reflects an enduring commitment to sustainable craftsmanship, social responsibility, and ecological balance.",
      "be1675395791_html": "The production of each bowl supports the local artisan communities in Kathmandu, Nepal, with fair compensation for their skill and tradition.\r",
      "be1008796937282_html": "<span data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiUWRJMzRtSWo5QldGZk1rMnJQdlpmMiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjIzNTQ5NzM0NCwiZGF0YVR5cGUiOiJzY2VuZSJ9Cg==(/figmeta)--&gt;\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Tibetan Singing Bowls: Healing that Resonates Alongside Science</span>",
      "be500272162_html": "The sounds harmonizing in the Himalayas have finally been echoed by scientific research.",
      "be1625568857_html": "Contemporary studies worldwide have verified, shared, and implemented the healing properties of sound waves and vibrations for physical, mental, and holistic well-being. Its notorious effects include: \r",
      "be900778061_html": "Improving physical comfort.\r",
      "be464065050_html": "Encouraging restful and rejuvenating sleep.\r",
      "be1346316758_html": "Fostering calmness and emotional balance.",
      "be1006418851_html": "Promoting cardiac health.\r",
      "be2140066559_html": "Enhancing the natural breathing rhythm.",
      "be886075890_html": "Nurturing mental clarity and emotional resilience.\r",
      "be1056699657_html": "Tibetan singing bowls, in particular, are scientifically-proven masterpieces of sound therapy.",
      "be57417316_html": "Three different studies in 2014, 2017, and 2020 found that Tibetan singing bowls enhance a state of deep peace during guided relaxation, with participants showing improved blood pressure and heart rate in comparison to standard sessions.",
      "be1662905887_html": "Some researchers even suggest that the melodies and vibrations of singing bowls may interact with the biofield, that is, the energy field believed to surround the human body. This interaction creates a “vibrational attunement” of the body and its biofield, which supports relaxation.",
      "be1451874691_html": "These studies are still unfolding, each seeking to decode the intricate mechanisms behind an ancient practice that generations have long trusted.",
      "be2122570306_html": "The Serenity Bowl, in its elegant form, brings together all the elements that tradition and science trust to induce an elevated state of relaxation: pure design, harmonic frequency, and exquisite aesthetics.",
      "be1960930937_html": "Discover Sound &amp; Flow",
      "be152374062_html": "A beautifully curated guide that unveils the art of resonance and the elegance of presence. Each page deepens your connection with the bowl, enriching the way sound moves through space and breath.\r",
      "be875930696_html": "Complimentary with every Serene Streams bowl.",
      "be1688019517_html": "Start Today",
      "be1164947387286_html": "<span data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiUWRJMzRtSWo5QldGZk1rMnJQdlpmMiIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjIzNTQ5NzM0NCwiZGF0YVR5cGUiOiJzY2VuZSJ9Cg==(/figmeta)--&gt;\"></span><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">The Art of Integrating Healing Sounds into Your Daily Ritual.&nbsp;</span>",
      "be1406762181_html": "Using a Tibetan singing bowl is beautifully simple. The practice is intuitive, inviting you to explore its resonance with ease.",
      "be254110891_html": "Hold the bowl gently in the palm of your non-dominant hand. \r",
      "be311391054_html": "Grab the mallet in your dominant hand, relaxing your shoulders and aligning your spine. \r",
      "be32467673_html": "Tap the bowl softly to warm up its tone. \r",
      "be1101964512_html": "Circle the rim with the mallet in a smooth, steady motion. Use a gentle movement of your arm to maintain consistent contact with the bowl.&nbsp;",
      "be2046673585_html": "Listen for the warm, clear tone. Soften your touch and let the sound flow. \r",
      "be1958804146_html": "The Serenity Bowl is a versatile companion to countless self-care rituals. Its resonance can ground your breath before meditation, amplify intention during manifestation, or ease you into the gentle flow of sleep during a nighttime routine.&nbsp;",
      "be84049_html": "The",
      "be1954065536_html": "&nbsp;Serene",
      "be552673881_html": "&nbsp;Advantage",
      "be461782767_html": "What Other Women Are Saying",
      "be368105045_html": "Letting it Flow, From Today Onwards.",
      "be1006485499_html": "Each Serenity bowl is shaped by hand; no machinery, no shortcuts. Crafted in exclusive batches, each one honors the integrity of the process, the devotion of the artisans, and the steady rhythm of their creation. \r",
      "be7078758_html": "To discover the art of fluid living and let serenity ripple through your senses, explore the collection today and welcome intentional calm into your space.\r"
    },
