      "be1037145088169_html": "<div>🔁 Support available for any product issue</div><br><div>↩️💸 Risk-free purchase</div><br><div>🛡️ Clear refund &amp; replacement policy shown before purchase</div>",
      "be1455049894_html": "Slash 15% off. Your wallet will thank you.",
      "be250504930_html": "Key Features",
      "be159045618_html": "Fast, Free Shipping",
      "be526016284_html": "Lifetime Customer Support",
      "be344312508150_html": "<div>&nbsp;Order Processing Time\r</div><div>Orders are processed within 1 to 3 business days (Monday to Friday, excluding holidays).</div><div>\r</div>",
